  "body": "The term `User Agent (UA)` is well defined in [HTML 4.01 Specification](https://www.w3.org/TR/html4/conform.html#didx-user_agent) as well as in [Cascading Style Sheets Level 2 Revision 1 (CSS 2.1) Specification](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS22/conform.html#ua).\r\n\r\nI am not sure if I can find a definition for `User Agent (UA)` in this specification. In case it is somehow \"derived\" I didn't spot it.",
